<div class="tab-pane" id="distributors">

	<div class="form-group"></div>

	<div class="panel-group" id="add-distributor-accordion">
		<div class="panel panel-default">
			<div class="panel-heading">
				<a class="accordion-toggle" data-toggle="collapse"
					data-parent="#add-distributor-accordion" href="#dist-collapse-one"><span
					class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus-sign"></span> Adicionar
					Distribuidor </a>
			</div>
			<div id="dist-collapse-one" class="panel-collapse collapse">
				<div class="panel-body">
					<div class="alert alert-info">
						<strong>Atenção!</strong> Utilize somente contas de jogadores
						Bronze+, pois captchas não são suportados.
					</div>
					<form id="add-dist-form" class="form-inline" role="form"
						onsubmit="return false;">
						<div class="form-group">
							<label class="sr-only" for="new-dist-name">Nome</label> <input
								type="text" class="form-control" id="new-dist-name"
								placeholder="Nome">
						</div>
						<div class="form-group">
							<label class="sr-only" for="new-dist-email">Email</label> <input
								type="email" class="form-control" id="new-dist-email"
								placeholder="Email" required>
						</div>
						<div class="form-group">
							<label class="sr-only" for="new-dist-password">Senha</label> <input
								type="password" class="form-control" id="new-dist-password"
								placeholder="Senha" required>
						</div>
						<a id="save-new-dist" data-toggle="modal"
							href="#addDistributorConfirmation" class="btn btn-primary"><span
							class="glyphicon glyphicon-floppy-disk"></span> Salvar</a>
					</form>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="text-center" data-bind="if: distributors().length == 0">
		<img id="dists-loader" src="../img/loader.cache.gif" />
	</div>

	<table class="table table-striped table-hover table-responsive"
		id="dists-table" data-bind="if: distributors().length > 0">
		<thead>
			<tr>
				<th>Nome</th>
				<th>E-mail</th>
				<th>Senha</th>
				<th>Último Acesso</th>
				<th></th>
			</tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody data-bind="foreach: distributors">
			<tr data-bind="attr: {id: encodedKey}">
				<td><input type="text" placeholder="nome/nick"
					data-bind="value: name"></td>
				<td><input type="email" placeholder="email"
					data-bind="value: email"></td>
				<td><input type="password" placeholder="senha"
					data-bind="value: password"></td>
				<td
					data-bind="text: lastAccessTimestamp ? $.format.date(new Date(lastAccessTimestamp), edist.format.date) : 'Não acessado'"></td>
				<td><a href="#" role="button"><span
						class="glyphicon glyphicon-floppy-disk"
						data-bind="click: $root.saveDistributor"></span></a></td>
			</tr>
		</tbody>
	</table>
	<div class="modal fade" id="addDistributorConfirmation" tabindex="-2"
		role="dialog" aria-hidden="true">
		<div class="modal-dialog">
			<div class="modal-content">
				<div class="modal-header">
					<button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal"
						aria-hidden="true">×</button>
					<h3>Confirmar Novo Distribuidor</h3>
				</div>
				<div class="modal-body">
					<p>Atenção!</p>
					<p>
						A conta do distribuidor será acessada pelo servidor, o que <i>pode</i>
						configurar quebra dos termos de uso.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Não é recomendável:</strong>
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Doar itens diretamente entre dois distribuidores</li>
						<li>Utilizar contas gestoras de empresas</li>
					</ul>
					<p>Os desenvolvedores do eDist não são responsáveis por
						qualquer ação da moderação do jogo sobre as contas cadastradas
						aqui.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="modal-footer">
					<button class="btn" data-dismiss="modal"
						data-bind="click: $root.addDistributor">Concordo,
						cadastrar</button>
					<button class="btn btn-danger" data-dismiss="modal"
						aria-hidden="true">Não concordo, cancelar</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>